    {
      "id": "mueqwcd4rat3pawcl3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1645,
      "y": 780,
      "width": 413,
      "height": 380,
      "angle": 0,
      "autoResize": true,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "boundElements": null,
      "containerId": null,
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "fontSize": 16,
      "frameId": null,
      "groupIds": [],
      "index": "a123",
      "isDeleted": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "1. Acyclic. Dependency edges only go\n   L0 → L1 → L2 → L3. No cycles, so\n   no rule can depend on itself.\n\n2. Sections are sources (in-degree 0).\n   Removing a source node deletes only\n   its own out-edges: slideshows is a\n   clean cut.\n\n3. Adding a section adds one node plus\n   edges into L2. Nothing existing changes.\n\n4. One home per rule. Each rule is one\n   node; every other file holds an edge\n   (a link) to it, never a copy.\n\n5. lint = edge checker. It rejects any\n   upward or sideways edge, account\n   names in core/, and dead links.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1883071463,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "text": "1. Acyclic. Dependency edges only go\n   L0 → L1 → L2 → L3. No cycles, so\n   no rule can depend on itself.\n\n2. Sections are sources (in-degree 0).\n   Removing a source node deletes only\n   its own out-edges: slideshows is a\n   clean cut.\n\n3. Adding a section adds one node plus\n   edges into L2. Nothing existing changes.\n\n4. One home per rule. Each rule is one\n   node; every other file holds an edge\n   (a link) to it, never a copy.\n\n5. lint = edge checker. It rejects any\n   upward or sideways edge, account\n   names in core/, and dead links.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "updated": 1790206785698,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1648659917,
      "verticalAlign": "middle"
    },
